            <ArticleTitle>Ex vivo partial nephrectomy and autotransplantation for renal cell cancer after laparoscopic renal harvest.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1182-3</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Laparoscopic partial nephrectomy is an alternative to the open approach. For centrally located tumors, open extracorporeal partial nephrectomy has been used. We report 2 cases of laparoscopic nephrectomy for the purpose of extracorporeal partial nephrectomy and autotransplantation for renal cell cancer.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
